2026-07-08 15:34:42,475 | AGENT | TechnicalArchitect Agent answered: To meet the client's requirements, I would design an architecture leveraging our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. We can utilize the platform's components such as the document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer, orchestration layer, and answer layer to provide fast and accurate responses.

For high availability during business hours and resilience to seasonal peak loads, I recommend hosting our solution on the High-availability premium tier, which provides additional redundancy and dedicated inference capacity. This will ensure that our system can handle peak loads and provide response times below 2 seconds for common queries, as our performance metrics indicate a median latency of 1.3 seconds and p95 latency below 2.5 seconds.

